{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":0,"y":-300,"width":1600,"height":140,"text":"# Dockerfile и слои образа\nУрок: [07 · Dockerfile и слои](../theory/07_dockerfile_and_layers.md) · [Dockerfile](../../../glossary/dockerfile.md) выполняется сверху вниз, каждая `RUN`/`COPY` даёт слой. [Кэш](../../../glossary/build-cache.md) ломается каскадом → редкое и долгое наверх. Образ только растёт.","color":"6"},
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":0,"y":-120,"width":760,"height":900,"label":"Dockerfile workspace: сверху вниз = от редкого к частому"},
		{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":30,"y":-80,"width":700,"height":80,"text":"① `FROM uv:python3.12-bookworm-slim` — Debian + Python + uv"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":30,"y":20,"width":700,"height":80,"text":"② `ARG UID GID` — входят в ключ **всех** RUN ниже"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":30,"y":120,"width":700,"height":90,"text":"③ `RUN apt-get update && install … && rm lists` — 90 МБ\nupdate и install в одном RUN, мусор удалён там же"},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":30,"y":230,"width":700,"height":80,"text":"④ `ARG DUCKDB_VERSION` + `RUN curl … && rm /tmp/duckdb.gz` — 62 МБ"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":30,"y":330,"width":700,"height":90,"text":"⑤ `RUN useradd -u ${UID} dev` + `chown /opt/venv`\n⑥ `USER dev` — дальше всё от dev"},
		{"id":"s7","type":"text","x":30,"y":440,"width":700,"height":90,"text":"⑦ `ENV UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/opt/venv`, `PATH=/opt/venv/bin:…`\n⑧ `WORKDIR /workspace` — закроет bind mount"},
		{"id":"s9","type":"text","x":30,"y":550,"width":700,"height":80,"text":"⑨ `COPY --chown=dev:dev pyproject.toml uv.lock ./` — только файлы зависимостей","color":"3"},
		{"id":"s10","type":"text","x":30,"y":650,"width":700,"height":100,"text":"⑩ `RUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project` — самый тяжёлый слой\nкод в образ не копируется: он приходит bind mount","color":"3"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":800,"y":-120,"width":800,"height":430,"label":"Кэш сборки"},
		{"id":"k1","type":"text","x":820,"y":-80,"width":760,"height":120,"text":"**Ключ шага** = ключ предка + текст инструкции с `ARG` + (для COPY) суммы файлов\nнайден → `CACHED`, нет → выполнить и **всё ниже тоже**"},
		{"id":"k2","type":"text","x":820,"y":60,"width":370,"height":230,"text":"⚠️ **RUN** — только текст\n`RUN apt-get update` отдельно застрянет в кэше навсегда"},
		{"id":"k3","type":"text","x":1210,"y":60,"width":370,"height":230,"text":"✅ **COPY** — содержимое\n`touch` кэш не ломает; правка `uv.lock` → ⑨ и ⑩ заново"},
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":800,"y":340,"width":800,"height":440,"label":"Вес, пользователи, пересборка"},
		{"id":"w1","type":"text","x":820,"y":380,"width":760,"height":110,"text":"**Образ только растёт**: `RUN rm` в новом слое = заглушка, файл остаётся ниже\n50 МБ файл + `rm` отдельно → 73.9 МБ; в одном RUN → 23.9 МБ\nкэши apt/pip/uv в слое — скрытый вес"},
		{"id":"w2","type":"text","x":820,"y":510,"width":760,"height":120,"text":"**[UID](../../../glossary/uid-gid.md)** — ядро знает числа, не имена\nroot → файлы root на хосте · UID 100 → Permission denied · UID 1000 = твой","color":"4"},
		{"id":"w3","type":"text","x":820,"y":650,"width":760,"height":110,"text":"**Добавить пакет**: `make uv ARGS=\"add …\"` → `make build` → `make up`\n`make up` сам не пересобирает; `pip install` в контейнере умрёт при restart","color":"5"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"a","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"b","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"c","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"d","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"e","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"f","fromNode":"s7","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"g","fromNode":"s9","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s10","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"частые правки","color":"3"},
		{"id":"h","fromNode":"s10","fromSide":"right","toNode":"w1","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"почему тяжёлый?"},
